    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A shattered world. A lost island. One journey to uncover the truth.</strong><br>The boundaries between realms are broken. You awaken on the shores of a mysterious island, its ruins whispering stories of those who came before. Explore haunting landscapes, meet strange and unforgettable characters, and face emotional choices that shape the path ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f <strong>A short narrative adventure</strong> designed for 1-2 hours of play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Emotional mini-stories</strong> blending mystery, consequence, and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Player-driven choices</strong> that change how the journey unfolds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized low-poly world</strong> balancing beauty and decay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Atmospheric original soundtrack</strong> to immerse you in the story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a fight for survival\u2014it\u2019s a search for meaning in a place where reality has fractured.</p>",
